## Intake tags

Intake tags come from the reporter's browser. They disagree with the cause on 38 reports. The cause depends on the tenant's form and locale, so this page uses the cause, not the tag.

Per-report causes are in `analysis/4471-causes.tsv` in the repo that holds this page.

